# Build context for docker/Dockerfile.agnostic (build-from-source + a zoo of
# shells): ship the sources, the checked-out submodules and the test scripts,
# but never host build artifacts or git internals. BuildKit prefers this file
# over the repo-root .dockerignore for this specific Dockerfile.
.git
**/.git
build/
vendor/libft/build
vendor/libft/build-*
**/*.o
**/*.a
npm/node_modules/
tests/outfiles/
tests/mini_outfiles/
tests/bash_outfiles/
*.log
